window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-055-95390c9a9be50fd0.json"]={sha256:"95390c9a9be50fd0da17e9b9faef3b9d8ae9decad31820382274094926ade15a",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-ff15b0b67f0cb15d","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08820-7","title":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","titleEn":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","publisher":"PsiQuantum team / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-055","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-055","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-056","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-04725-x"],"title":"Borealis 壓縮光：dB、真空雜訊與損耗","titleEn":"Borealis squeezed light: decibels, vacuum noise and loss","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學判準同時要求背景≤5/s且保留至少95%相關峰面積，不能只滿足背景。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The teaching criterion requires background≤5/s and≥95% retained peak area, not background alone. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"把雜訊dB轉成線性變異數，計算損耗混入真空雜訊。","differenceEn":"Convert noise decibels to linear variance and calculate vacuum noise mixed in by loss.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。兩偵測器單計數率各100000/s，總時間窗2 ns。 R偶然=10⁵×10⁵×2×10⁻⁹。 代入 1e5*1e5*2e-9，得到 20 events/s。低佔用且獨立卜瓦松計數時R偶然=R₁R₂W；W是總窗寬，非半窗。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。輸入變異數0.25（約−6.02dB），透射η=0.8。 V出=0.8×0.25+0.2。 代入 0.8*0.25+(1-0.8)，得到 0.4 vacuum-normalized variance。以真空變異數1正規化，V出=ηV入+(1−η)；適用純損耗通道，不含額外技術雜訊。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Each detector records100000/s; the full coincidence window is2 ns. Racc=10^5×10^5×2×10^-9. Substituting 1e5*1e5*2e-9 gives 20 events/s. For low-occupancy independent Poisson streams Racc=R1R2W; W is full width, not half width. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Input variance0.25 (about−6.02dB), transmissionη=0.8. Vout=0.8×0.25+0.2. Substituting 0.8*0.25+(1-0.8) gives 0.4 vacuum-normalized variance. Normalize vacuum variance to1: Vout=ηVin+(1−η), a pure-loss channel without added technical noise. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-065","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-05117-x"],"title":"矽自旋 Ramsey：準靜態雜訊與相干包絡","titleEn":"Silicon-spin Ramsey: quasistatic noise and coherence envelopes","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學判準同時要求背景≤5/s且保留至少95%相關峰面積，不能只滿足背景。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The teaching criterion requires background≤5/s and≥95% retained peak area, not background alone. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"比較高斯相干衰減與單一指數衰減，避免只報一個T₂數字。","differenceEn":"Compare Gaussian and exponential coherence decay instead of reporting an unexplainedT2.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。兩偵測器單計數率各100000/s，總時間窗2 ns。 R偶然=10⁵×10⁵×2×10⁻⁹。 代入 1e5*1e5*2e-9，得到 20 events/s。低佔用且獨立卜瓦松計數時R偶然=R₁R₂W；W是總窗寬，非半窗。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。延遲t=10μs，T₂*=20μs，起始對比已正規化為1。 C=exp[−(10/20)²]。 代入 exp(-(10/20)**2)，得到 0.778801 normalized contrast。準靜態高斯失諧下取C(t)=exp[−(t/T₂*)²]；這是歸一化包絡，非完整振盪訊號。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Each detector records100000/s; the full coincidence window is2 ns. Racc=10^5×10^5×2×10^-9. Substituting 1e5*1e5*2e-9 gives 20 events/s. For low-occupancy independent Poisson streams Racc=R1R2W; W is full width, not half width. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Delayt=10μs, T2*=20μs and normalized initial contrast1. C=exp[−(10/20)²]. Substituting exp(-(10/20)**2) gives 0.778801 normalized contrast. For quasistatic Gaussian detuning use C(t)=exp[−(t/T2*)²], a normalized envelope rather than the full oscillation. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-3e576f5c7b567070","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-04725-x","title":"Quantum computational advantage with a programmable photonic processor","titleEn":"Quantum computational advantage with a programmable photonic processor","publisher":"Xanadu and collaborators / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-fd900ae8f3096a90","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-022-05117-x","title":"Universal control of a six-qubit quantum processor in silicon","titleEn":"Universal control of a six-qubit quantum processor in silicon","publisher":"Philips et al. / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
